Text_en:
// Why did Centcom commander Brad Cooper join the talks in Oman? 
Military commanders rarely and in special cases join political negotiations. That is, when the military threat is "real and imminent". The message of Cooper's presence is clear: if the negotiations fail, I will implement the next scenario. 
