text:
 My exclusive report: Iran has sentenced a former IAEA scientist to 10 years in prison for allegedly spying for the UK.
While Amir Reza Jalilian has been imprisoned since August last year, neither the IAEA nor Iranian authorities have commented on his case.
@rafaelmgrossi

